14. Final project summary
Monthly Mutt Counter is a lightweight, authenticated, increment-only tracker. The owner logs in, clicks +1 to record activity within the current calendar month, and returns at any time to see the saved number. When the calendar moves to a new month in Asia/Dhaka, the active display starts from zero while the previous month's result remains available in read-only History. GitHub Pages serves the website; Supabase stores the account and monthly records. The code is maintained locally in VS Code and published from the GitHub main branch.

